      351           view-as alert-box .
      352         Return  .
      353       End.
      354       run gbl/prnfilen.w
      355         (input  ""
      356         ,input  p-DisabledOptions
      357         ,input  string(v-report-name )
      358         ,input  7
      359         ,output v-user-action
      360         ,output v-printed
      361         ) .
      362       if v-printed then
